Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.27,0:23:41.02,Sign,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\an1\fad(1187,1)\fs16\c&HFDF5F9&\3c&H5A0A38&\blur3\b0\pos(235.46,208.22)}Vai ficar ainda mais intenso
